{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お久しぶりです\n最近何があったかな~と写真フォルダを振り返っていたら、年末に… 早いよ怖いです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "AFA Singapore 2025"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました~\n初めてのシンガポールです\n今年も沢山の国にどれも櫻坂46として訪れることができて嬉しかったです  🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobOeGhAC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobPVwYdb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうして先輩方が着てらっしゃった衣装を着ることが出来る機会があるといつも嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobyZdLHb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いとちゃんが撮ってくれた~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また来年も櫻坂46が好きな皆さんの元に沢山会いに行けますように。\nありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "13枚目シングルリアルミート＆グリート"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました~~\n日々のオンラインミート＆グリートもありがとう\nございます ☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobj0n9Bo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobbaTVxr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも素敵な祝花を沢山ありがとうございます\nちゃんと記憶に残してます🍀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、嬉しいお知らせです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現在マクドナルドさんのダブルチーズバーガーのWebCMに 谷口愛季と出演させて頂いています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobVG1oza.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mob7GOMYg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マブダチダブチ     ☆\n撮影の日の夜ご飯はもちろんマクドナルド食べました~~~ 撮影中もずっと食べたくて~\n食べるシーンを楽しみに撮影していました🫢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非ご覧ください\nマクドナルドさんありがとうございました ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mob52RvFO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobz1da4s.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなも一緒に毎日ダブチ食べようね  【PR】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddies 感謝祭EX\nありがとうございました🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobVrNGh8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobN8V9hN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobDKNkmK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddies感謝祭でしか味わえない空気感\nいいよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobRAK00l.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご卒業されると聞いてから時間はあったはずなのに行動に移すのが遅い自分…\nちゃんと後悔なくお話することができました\n良かった、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドレス姿とっても綺麗でした\nずっと優しくして下さり かっこいい背中を見せてくださりありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご卒業おめでとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobvGOC3T.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CDTV ライブ！ライブ！\nありがとうございました~~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新衣装です   かわいい\nりかが言ってくれた髪型でした (  ¯꒳​¯ )ᐝ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobMjOvfo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobh8h0FS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2025年を振り返ると新しいことに挑戦させていただけた1年だったな…と思います\nグループの為に自分ができることは何かなと思いながら、活動のことを考えている話している時。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "凄く活き活きしている自分がいて\n櫻坂46を少しでも多くの方に知っていただきたい思いがより一層また強くなった1年でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はあんまりその年の目標とかを決めないタイプなのですが、来年自分自身に強く思うことができました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年はグループ、先輩方、同期、今年入ってきてくれた4期生みんなのそれぞれの強いところを沢山近くで見ることができた1年でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "近くで感じることができればできるほど\n凄いな…ありがたいな…と感心し、それと同時に自分自身の弱さを痛感する場面も多くあり\n凄く沢山の刺激を得た1年だったな…\nと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年はその刺激を自分の中に入れれたらな。\nと思います。  目標"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは 少し早いけど良いお年をお過ごし下さい  またね"}], "source": "official"}